@startuml

actor Client as "用户"
participant Controller
participant Service
participant Mapper
database Database

Client -> Controller: 发送登录请求
Controller -> Controller: 接收请求
Controller -> Service: 调用login方法
Service -> Mapper: 根据用户名查询用户信息
Mapper -> Database: 查询用户信息
Database --> Mapper: 返回用户信息
Mapper --> Service: 返回用户信息
Service -> Service: 验证用户信息
alt 用户名或密码错误
    Service --> Controller: 抛出用户名或密码错误异常
    Controller --> Client: 返回异常信息
else 用户状态正常
    Service -> Service: 生成Token
    Service -> Controller: 返回登录结果
    Controller -> Client: 返回登录结果
end

@enduml
